==Strafe==
[[File:Lava.png|50px|right|Mini Lava]]
The Strafe skill on the special skill bar is locked and requires a key
'''NOTE: Strafe reduce the cooldowns of other skills by 1 second every second this buff is in effect. Strafe has 10 seconds duration and no cooldown.''' 
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="width:100;min-height:100px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);" data-expandtext="Show solution" data-collapsetext="Hide solution">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content" style="">
The key can be found by talking to Mini Lava on the [[portal]] screen. Keep trying; He has a lot to say. <br />
'''NOTE: You have to exit the portal and come back. Won't work if you keep trying at one visit. Lava's usual text is colored green; if you talk to him and see red text, you should get the key the next time you visit and talk to him.''' 
</div>
</div>

