==Vamp==
[[File:Vamp_creature.png|50px|right|Vamp creature]]
In the [[asylum]] is a small human-like creature found to the right of Gorshank. Clicking on him prompts you to show him some resources.
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="width:100%;min-height:100px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);" data-expandtext="Show solution" data-collapsetext="Hide solution">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content" style="">
#Collect 1500 tilling [[Asylum#Traces|Traces]].
#Collect 1,000,000,000 warpium (15th mining ore). Requires 87 [[mining]]
#Collect 8,000,000 fyrelings (13th botany plant). Requires level 36 [[botany]].
#Collect 5 orange star cards. (are kept)
#Collect 3,000,000 botany [[Asylum#Traces|Traces]].

After showing the creature these resources, it will give you a key. This unlocks the vamp skill on the special skill bar.
</div>
</div>

==Caged Slime==
[[File:Caged_Slime.png|50px|right|Golden Slime]]
In the [[tunnels]], when trying to add a Spelunker, there is a golden slime in a cage.
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="width:100;min-height:100px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.1);" data-expandtext="Show solution" data-collapsetext="Hide solution">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content" style="">
#Collect 4 Baubles, the first Darkmode plant in Botany.
#Collect 6 Trillion of the first loot of Father Of All (Crusade 15).
#Get 3 million "Maybe soap" (10th spelunking treasure).
#Get one "Normal Rook" (15th dark mode botany plant).
#Collect 1 green unit of "Banana Vines" (10th dark mode tilling crop).
#Collect 1 Trillion green unit of "Saharan Foal" (9th light mode botany plant).
After showing the creature these resources, it will be in your pet inventory. You have unlocked the 56th pet.
